READING OF THE BRANCH

  install_mvn() returns early when build/apache-maven-<version>/bin/mvn already
  exists. Otherwise it takes the mvn on PATH, parses its version, and downloads only
  when version(detected) != version(required). Equality therefore makes the download
  unreachable, which is what STEP 2 and STEP 4 together establish.
